{"time": 1757863139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1373240123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "你走近光头修格斯，发现祂的光头是在头顶拟态了一个人类秃顶的头顶"}
{"time": 1757863150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "515891700", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我是修卤蛋啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！”\n “哈哈哈哈哈哈你想问什么啊啊啊啊啊啊——”"}
{"time": 1757863367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1060770238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=964E85BDBA5240A314D9FDA6AD2412CB.png,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhSPBpeSLH-A96zHPjrDrhmqe_kmmBil4WMg_woowrqWrMfYjwMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQAGacWM9C_DT1sYQlVkaNxnoC_P6CAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAMSMKcFi4vTfF3lDvLTwHOX6x672hO-4YX7RNoAfjvd3yC9YS0VLh8hroJfqu6OJvJq8w,file_size=1634469]"}
{"time": 1757863628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "984250519", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1373240123]（装填了）"}
{"time": 1757863639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "375819065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1060770238]（弄个精华）"}
{"time": 1757863810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1748105706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“修卤蛋先生，你的头好帅呀，什么时候弄的？”"}
{"time": 1757863996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1236854132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“我很喜欢人类的文化哦哦哦哦哦，所以我就拟态人类的光头当标识啊啊啊啊啊”"}
{"time": 1757864026, "type": "recv", "message_id": "61667378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“因为我们每个修都有不同的发型嗷嗷嗷嗷嗷嗷，我在移民过来以后就这样了啊啊啊啊啊”"}
{"time": 1757864063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "850421310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "408119794"}, "sender": {"id": "408119794", "name": "森の月"}, "message": "“诶？你们修格斯换了拟态以后，还能保留原来的拟态的吗”"}
{"time": 1757864102, "type": "recv", "message_id": "141169782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": "“可以拟态部分身体的嗷嗷嗷嗷”"}
{"time": 1757865196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "413558457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "264175027", "user_id": "2468514664"}, "sender": {"id": "2468514664", "name": "夜鹿夜游真夜中"}, "message": ".log off"}
